        "applies_to_table": "sub_batches",
        "applies_to_column": "status",
        "count_target_table": "wafers",
        "count_target_column": "id",
        "join_path": "wafers.batch_id = batches.id → sub_batches.batch_id = batches.id → sub_batches.current_station_id = stations.id",
        "note": "WIP是Wafer实例的状态属性。统计WIP数量=COUNT(DISTINCT wafers.id)（因batch→sub_batch一对多会重复），通过wafers→batches→sub_batches路径获取状态过滤条件"
